{"book":"1chronicles","num":19,"verses":[{"en":"Now it came to pass after this, that Nahash the king of the children of Ammon died, and his son reigned in his stead.","n":1,"sm":"O le agaleagaina o le savali a Tavita, ma le taua na tupu ai Naasa le tupu o le fanauga a Amoni; ona soloai ane ai lea o lona atalii e fai ma tupu.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"agaleagaina"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"savali"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"Tavita,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"taua"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"tupu"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"Naasa"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tupu"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"fanauga"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"Amoni;"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"soloai"},{"en":"","sm":"ane"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"lona"},{"en":"","sm":"atalii"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"tupu."}]},{"en":"And David said, I will shew kindness unto Hanun the son of Nahash, because his father shewed kindness to me. And David sent messengers to comfort him concerning his father. So the servants of David came into the land of the children of Ammon to Hanun, to comfort him.","n":2,"sm":"Ona faapea ane ai lea o Tavita, Ou te agalelei atu ia Anuni, le atalii o Naasa, aua na agalelei mai lona tama ia te au. Ona auina atu ai lea e Tavita o le savali e faamatalaloto ia te ia ona O lona tama. Ua oo atu auauna a Tavita i le nuu o le fanauga a Amoni ia Anuni e faamatalaloto ia te ia.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ona"},{"en":"","sm":"faapea"},{"en":"","sm":"ane"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Tavita,"},{"en":"","sm":"Ou"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"agalelei"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"Anuni,"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"atalii"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en"